### ❌ Don't Use Raw Modus CSS Variables Directly

**Use Tailwind classes instead of raw Modus variables:**

```tsx
// ❌ WRONG - Raw Modus variables
<div
  style={{
    backgroundColor: "var(--modus-wc-color-base-page)",
    borderColor: "var(--modus-wc-color-base-200)",
    color: "var(--modus-wc-color-base-content)",
